#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:5 51e999bff24b42f98a637dae3643c748
msgid "GUIDED Mode"
msgstr "GUIDED 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:7 6068eeb77a1f40069ee5558653a12604
msgid ""
"The GUIDED mode is used when you want the aircraft to fly to a specific "
"point on the map without setting up a mission. Most ground control stations "
"support a \"click to fly to\" feature where you can click a point on the map"
" and the aircraft will fly to that location then loiter."
msgstr ""
"GUIDED "
"模式用于当您希望飞机飞向地图上特定点而无需设置任务时。大多数地面控制站支持「点击飞往」功能，您可以点击地图上的某点，飞机将飞往该位置然后盘旋。"

#: ../../source/docs/guided-mode.rst:12 60d23cea09a3465baa5ed9a46f8b8ad7
msgid ""
"The other major use for GUIDED mode is in :ref:`geo-fencing <geofencing>`. "
"When the geo-fence is breached the aircraft will enter GUIDED mode, and head"
" to the predefined geo-fence return point, where it will loiter until the "
"operator takes over."
msgstr ""
"GUIDED 模式的另一个主要用途是 :ref:`地理围栏 <geofencing>`。当突破地理围栏时，飞机将进入 GUIDED "
"模式，并飞往预定义的地理围栏返回点，在那里盘旋直到操作员接管。"
